- Draft a note you can bring to your appointment as a checklist of questions?

Also please confirm:
- Your actual current medication list and doses (including PPI/H2/antacids)
- Whether your “BP was 28” was a typo and what the real reading was
- Any recent DEXA or labs and any GI alarm symptoms

