Quick clarifying questions
- Can you confirm your sex (male or female) and whether you’re menopausal (if female)? This changes screening recommendations.
- Please confirm your current medication list (names + doses). In your message some meds look swapped: metformin is for diabetes, metoprolol is for blood pressure/heart disease, and GERD is usually treated with a PPI (omeprazole, pantoprazole) or H2 blocker. Which medicine(s) are you taking for GERD and for HTN?
