- Draft a referral request to Boston GI (I can include your symptoms and risk factors)?
- Or help you prepare a one‑page summary to bring to the appointment?

If you confirm your sex, current meds (and clarify the “BP 28”), and whether you have alarm GI symptoms or past DXA, I’ll tailor the plan and can draft the exact email/script for you.

