- “Can we review my current meds — I want to confirm which drug treats which condition (metformin, metoprolol, PPI, etc.). Are any of my meds affecting my bone or fall risk?”
- “Do I need a DEXA scan now? If I already have one, can we calculate my FRAX risk and review whether drug therapy is indicated?”
- “What do my labs show (vitamin D, calcium, kidney function, TSH)? Should anything else be checked?”
- “Given my heart failure and any other conditions, am I at higher fracture risk and should we consider medication now or just monitor?”
- “Do I need a GI referral for endoscopy or specialist care for my GERD? What are the alarm signs that would make that urgent?”

